            "block_content": "or responsible for any unlawful or illegal acts of its individual members in causing or participating in unauthorized strikes, stoppages of work, slowdowns, walk-outs, boycotts, handbilling, picketing, refusal to handle any product or other interruptions or interferences with the Company's operations provided that:",
