        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "An additional week will be posted on the 1st, 2nd, 5th, 12th, and 20th anniversary of the most recent date of hire or vacation eligibility date if later for each employee. Once an employee qualifies for an additional week he/she is thereafter eligible for the additional week as of January 1st of the succeeding year provided they meet eligibility requirements for vacation. An employee must be actively employed as of January 1st of the year to be eligible for vacation time.",
